          <p class="eyebrow mb-3">Overview</p>
          <h2 class="section-title">Identity as the foundation of security</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="prose-content">
          <p>MEAICON's identity and access management practice recognises that in a world of cloud applications, remote workforces, and partner ecosystems, identity is the primary control plane for security. We design IAM architectures that enforce least-privilege access, provide strong authentication, and maintain comprehensive audit trails.</p>
          <p>Our approach spans the full identity lifecycle — from onboarding and role assignment through periodic access reviews and timely deprovisioning. We implement multi-factor authentication to strengthen credential security, deploy privileged access management to control and monitor administrative access, and architect zero-trust identity frameworks where every access decision is evaluated in real time.</p>
        </div>
